# Story secrets — never commit to a public repo.
#
# js/stories/ holds every story whole — secrets and solutions — and
# js/admin-seed.js lists them for admin/seed.html, the one-time
# loader run from localhost. Afterwards the stories live in Firestore
# and are edited through admin/story.html.
#
# _redirects also blocks these on Netlify, in case they are ever
# deployed by drag-and-drop rather than from this repo.
js/admin-seed.js
js/stories/
admin/seed.html

# Local tooling
.claude/

# Story exports from the editor hold every secret and the ending.
# The site has no JSON files of its own, so none belong in this repo.
*.json
